        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    beginning_inventory_units = 200\n    beginning_inventory_cost = 1250.00\n\n    may_4_units = 20\n    may_4_unit_cost = 5.80\n\n    may_17_units = 80\n    may_17_unit_cost = 5.50\n\n    units_sold = 10\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_units_available = beginning_inventory_units + may_4_units + may_17_units\n    total_inventory_cost = (\n        beginning_inventory_cost\n        + may_4_units * may_4_unit_cost\n        + may_17_units * may_17_unit_cost\n    )\n\n    weighted_average_cost = total_inventory_cost / total_units_available\n    weighted_average_cogs = weighted_average_cost * units_sold\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(weighted_average_cogs, 2)\n```",
